    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are hotlines but they just give you scripts. they don't change the reality of what i did. it's like... if someone breaks something permanent, you don't just patch it up and pretend it's fine. you have to accept the damage. i just feel like i'm just dragging this guilt around and making it everyone else's problem. wouldnt it be more honest to just stop the cycle?",
